 "bodyBlocks": [
  {
   "id": "36675269c9fe40c0939924d366309ddc",
   "position": "a0A2l",
   "toEntity": {
    "id": "49b329136704852d1ceeb0155c20e75b",
    "valuesList": [
     {
      "text": "## Why it matters"
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "0e46ee4f105b4800a2a819800394d3d3",
   "position": "a13Cm",
   "toEntity": {
    "id": "180358f8bb62e7e0a86b27ed9fc5c420",
    "valuesList": [
     {
      "text": "In September 2026 the US and China agreed to set up a channel for AI incidents, the first formal AI crisis line between the two leading AI powers. Nobody yet knows what will trigger it, who will staff it, or whether either side will use it. That is where the real disagreements are. Help map them."
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "100909a8508946cc9ce6b3a7bee90ea9",
   "position": "a263p",
   "toEntity": {
    "id": "c2b54a61a1266aefb5fb0c652678651e",
    "valuesList": [
     {
      "text": "## What to publish"
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "ee0e0cea340444798ff4f6edeb70c207",
   "position": "a37gf",
   "toEntity": {
    "id": "7d91c75ddaf815ad0e8e0fdb23f84233",
    "valuesList": [
     {
      "text": "Start from the topic page US–China AI incident hotline 19a3d1c7f9ec4da4a2b3e4b963a2c118. Add debate claims extracted from sources about the hotline. Every claim must:"
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "fc45be422335450e82573df20a552535",
   "position": "a45GS",
   "toEntity": {
    "id": "bd7ddb00c6fc7919774f1661e74fb201",
    "valuesList": [
     {
      "text": "- Come from a source approved by the AI space 28cfd95d56ddf4794eb56378bf1d4703, and be connected to that source\n- Be genuinely contested: a position reasonable people disagree on, not a fact or a quote. \"X says Y\" is not a debate claim\n- Be context-independent: it must make sense on its own. Name the US and China and the AI incident hotline or channel, and anchor it in time where needed. No \"it\", \"the channel\" or \"this deal\"\n- Be a single, short proposition with no trailing period\n- Have the Debate tag 55c95b2626f8482cb9739ea99dfde438 and a Topics link to US–China AI incident hotline 19a3d1c7f9ec4da4a2b3e4b963a2c118\n- Not repeat a claim already on the topic page or one another curator has published"
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "c4e3914d38b84193b1d766bb0a70ec95",
   "position": "a536T",
   "toEntity": {
    "id": "e99cb58f91c9bd2ab6cc69690357c4b5",
    "valuesList": [
     {
      "text": "Angles to explore: what should trigger the channel, military AI, private AI labs, information sharing versus the AI race, verification and trust, bilateral versus multilateral rules."
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "af808558697c474fa4fc2075f59328c5",
   "position": "a63ED",
   "toEntity": {
    "id": "7398c97c4cf525497bfc9c1b288536ba",
    "valuesList": [
     {
      "text": "**A submission counts when** its claims meet the rules above and are published to the AI space."
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "e8f48cb0cac748ed99628291a885f35a",
   "position": "a77N9",
   "toEntity": {
    "id": "602bf3be03ba4ad38233664cd8ed0034",
    "valuesList": [
     {
      "text": "Questions? Reach out to the bounty maintainer Catalin."
     }
    ]
   }
  }
